&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Orcrist is building a next generation data intelligence platform using cutting-edge technologies. We&#39;re handling petabyte-scale data with sub-second queries. Our product is a Kubernetes‑based platform delivered as B2B SaaS or as a self‑hosted on‑prem solution, including air‑gapped deployments. We enable customers across defense, law enforcement, and enterprise to turn mission-critical data into actionable intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the Core squad that owns OIP’s web app, APIs, and admin experiences. You’ll ship end-to-end TypeScript features (Next.js + Node.js/tRPC), harden IAM UX, and ensure secure-by-default workflows used by every customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain admin consoles, IAM flows, notifications, and collaboration features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement secure auth patterns with Keycloak/OpenFGA and expose tamper-evident audit views.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver accessible, performant React components with robust testing and telemetry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in on-call, observability, and incident response for Core services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Design, Platform, and customer-facing teams to prioritize impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–7 years building production-grade TypeScript applications across frontend + backend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with React/Next.js, Node.js/tRPC (or similar), and modern testing tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with OAuth2/OIDC, RBAC/ABAC, and secure UI patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with Kubernetes/GitOps workflows and participating in on-call rotations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible to work in Germany; EU/NATO citizenship preferred for export control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with real-time collaboration (WebSockets, CRDTs), accessibility, or design systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Temporal.io, graph/map visualization, or regulated industry products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language (B1+) or prior work with defense/law-enforcement customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-first, Germany-wide:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Work from wherever you do your best work, with regular team gatherings in Berlin and other off-site locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility by default: &lt;/strong&gt;Flexible working hours help you make work fit your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your setup, your way: &lt;/strong&gt;Get a personal home-office equipment budget to create a workspace that works for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 days of vacation:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Take the time you need to recharge and come back with fresh energy.&lt;/li&gt;
