&lt;p&gt;Must have&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 4+ years of professional experience in finance &amp;amp; accounting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● German at a fluent professional level (C1/C2), including German accounting and tax terminology; English at least B1, as our team is diverse and English is often the working language&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Very good DATEV skills and solid understanding of the chart of accounts and correct account assignment&lt;/p&gt;
