&lt;li&gt;Lead opportunities from first meeting through technical validation, security and procurement, pricing, negotiation, and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate MinIO&#39;s value to technical and business stakeholders, tying architecture to measurable customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand and retain assigned customers by identifying new workloads, capacity, use cases, and business units, and hand off cleanly to post-sale teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use MEDDPICC or a comparable method, and keep accurate pipeline, forecasts, activity, and next steps in Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Field Architects, Marketing, Customer Success, Product, and partners to deliver a strong customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share what you learn in the field to help sharpen MinIO&#39;s commercial playb

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 200+ public data centers globally and thousands of private sites at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
